{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bdfabcdf-5774-862a-ba28-3a8984008f15",
  "created_at": "2026-02-06T11:51:05-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yusuf Rahman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Luis Barros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:48:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance department, this is Luis. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:48:23-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. Yes, my name is Yusuf Rahman. I am calling about the property tax. I have a question, please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:48:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, Mr. Rahman. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:48:34-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am eighty-some years old, and I wonder, is there an exemption for the seniors? Or maybe for the veterans? I am not sure which one is for me. How do I apply for it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:48:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There are exemptions for both, yes. Seniors and veterans can each have some kind of property tax relief. Are you a veteran yourself, or is it the age?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:48:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, I was not in the army. Only the age. So, the senior one. Como se diz... how do I say... what do I need to do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:49:10-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time. That application goes through the assessor's office, not finance. They'll tell you what paperwork you need to bring, like proof of age and proof that you live in the house. I can't tell you the exact qualifications from here, they'll go through that with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:49:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, the assessor. Okay. And do you know the hours of that office? When can I go there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:49:37-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They're in City Hall, same as us. Regular weekday hours, morning to late afternoon, Monday through Friday. I'd call ahead to confirm before you make the trip, though, in case they're at lunch or short-staffed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:49:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, yes. Monday through Friday. And today is Friday, so maybe I go on Monday. Is better."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:49:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday sounds smart. It's almost noon on a Friday, and you don't want to hit a lunch break or the end of the week rush."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:50:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] You are right. Excuse me, you said morning to afternoon. Is not open at night?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:50:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, not at night. Daytime only, weekdays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:50:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I write it down. Monday, morning. Assessor, in City Hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:50:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Bring something with your birth date on it, like a license, and a recent tax bill if you have one. That'll get you started."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:50:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I have the bill here. My goodness, it is already February. The year, it went so fast. It was the tax bill last time I think, and now again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:50:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It does that. Blink and it's the next quarter. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:50:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. You were very kind. Thank you very much, Mr. Luis."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:50:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My pleasure, Mr. Rahman. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-06T11:51:03-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You also. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
